          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mal Keshar",
            text: _("... wait what am I doing? A skeleton cannot taste or smell or eat anything. These shrooms do not work on me. Do you think I am a fool? Am I just some kind of bad actor hired for amusement? What kind of sadistic higher power makes poor old lonely liches like me suffer so much just for the sake of entertainment? How revolting. I hope your sick enjoyment at my predicament is worth it, you monster."),
